// 🧩 Symbol roll for SlateCompute — Three resident lookup surfaces replacing per-pixel marching — and the only source of environmental light in Slate.

%format   symbolindex 1.0
%scope    layer
%path     Engine/SlateCompute
%folders  28
%symbols  671

